## Let viewers search the graph and use Graph Chat
================================================================================

Context: PermissionMiddleware blocked every POST on domain-scoped paths for
the Viewer role. Explorer search/expand (/dtwin/sync/filter) and Graph Chat
(/dtwin/assistant/chat, /chat/stream, and the agent's query_graphql loopback
to /dtwin/graphql/execute) take a POST body but only read, so a Viewer could
open the Knowledge Graph but not search it or chat. Extract
_viewer_write_blocked so PermissionMiddleware.dispatch does not grow past
the size-budget baseline (186 LOC).

Changes:

1. src/shared/fastapi/main.py
   Add _VIEWER_READ_ONLY_POSTS (exact paths, POST only) and
   _viewer_write_blocked; skip the viewer write gate for those POSTs.
   Graph Chat writes (/dtwin/nodes/action/request, /confirm) and
   /dtwin/sync/load stay blocked.
2. tests/units/auth/test_permission_middleware.py
   Dispatch tests for all four allowlisted paths (GET/POST allowed;
   PUT/PATCH/DELETE blocked; non-members blocked). Write POSTs and
   prefix-sharing paths stay 403; editors can still POST writes.
   TestViewerWriteBlocked covers _viewer_write_blocked and pins the
   allowlist set.
3. docs/development.md
   Document the Viewer POST exceptions in the enforcement table.

Modified files:
- src/shared/fastapi/main.py
- tests/units/auth/test_permission_middleware.py
- docs/development.md
